#: ../../modules/vector.md:109 8917cafa06d345eeb8a8672a45e28b3a
msgid "Get the equivalent of the vector passed in parameter in a base with a different rotation. Useful to convert absolute/relative positions into local positions."
msgstr "获取传入参数向量在另一旋转基下的等效向量，可用于将绝对/相对坐标转换为局部坐标系中的位置。"

