#: ../../modules/vector.md:352 ../../modules/vector.md:424
#: 368bc6adc6af4ec1800d16af509a49ed 71ea6d4d3f7a46deb158bbf3ca9c8518
msgid "Performance Tip"
msgstr "性能提示"

#: ../../modules/vector.md:355 d3046aef89d64f9f963bfab1ad378992
msgid "To minimize performance impact, we recommend using the `length_squared` function instead of this one when possible. Computing the length of a vector requires a square root operation, which is computationally intensive, especially in Minecraft."
msgstr "为了最小化性能影响，我们建议尽可能使用 `length_squared` 函数代替此函数。计算向量的长度需要进行平方根运算，这在计算上很耗费资源，特别是在 Minecraft 中。"

#: ../../modules/vector.md:357 d307049279244e68b4f3f52238636105
msgid "`length_squared` can be used effectively in these cases:"
msgstr "`length_squared` 在以下情况下可以有效使用："

#: ../../modules/vector.md:358 d1564da6ff884d01bddc849fd334247c
msgid "When comparing a vector's length with a given value, compute the square of the given value manually and compare it with the result of `length_squared`."
msgstr "当比较向量长度与给定值时，手动计算给定值的平方并与 `length_squared` 的结果进行比较。"

#: ../../modules/vector.md:359 b639a80cc3ab4ed88f9c62e0af1ad98f
msgid "When comparing the lengths of two vectors, compare their `length_squared` results instead of computing their actual lengths."
